---
/**
 * Declaring a move between two states, and editing one.
 *
 * The ordered pair **is** the move's address, so on an edit the two ends are shown and not
 * asked: repointing an arrow is withdrawing one move and declaring another — two decisions, two
 * lines in the trail. On a create they are the first two questions, and both pickers are filled
 * per workflow when the dialog opens, because which states exist changes while the operator
 * works.
 *
 * `guard` is offered from `GET /api/v1/workflows/guards` rather than from a list written here,
 * which is what keeps CLAUDE.md rule 8 true across the wire: a guard is one function plus one
 * decorator on the backend, and this picker follows with no second edit. It is also the one part
 * of a move whose outcome nothing may predict — a client cannot compute whether it will pass, so
 * it appears only where a move is *authored*.
 *
 * The restore button below the error is the answer to a refusal nothing else could resolve: a
 * withdrawn move is absent from every read, a second row for the same pair is forbidden by
 * constraint, so `POST` can only ever answer 409 — and "ya existe" about something invisible is
 * a dead end unless the way out is right there.
 */
import Icon from "../ui/Icon.astro";
import GraphPicker from "./GraphPicker.astro";
---

<dialog class="dialog" data-move-dialog aria-labelledby="move-dialog-title">
  <form data-move-form novalidate>
    <h2 class="h2" id="move-dialog-title" data-field="move-dialog-title">
      Nuevo movimiento
    </h2>
    <p class="small lead" data-field="move-dialog-lead">
      Declarar un movimiento no cambia ningún registro: abre el paso desde el
      estado de origen, y cada proyecto o tarea sigue decidiéndose por separado.
    </p>

    <div class="pair" data-field="move-ends-field">
      <GraphPicker
        facet="move-from"
        label="Desde"
        placeholder="Elige un estado"
      />
      <GraphPicker
        facet="move-to"
        label="Hacia"
        placeholder="Elige un estado"
      />
    </div>

    <p class="field ends" data-field="move-ends-line" hidden>
      <span class="label">Movimiento</span>
      <span class="ends-value">
        <code class="chip chip-code" data-field="move-from-value"></code>
        <Icon name="chevron-right" size={16} />
        <code class="chip chip-code" data-field="move-to-value"></code>
      </span>
      <span class="small hint">
        Los dos extremos son la dirección del movimiento y no se editan: para
        repuntar la flecha, retira este movimiento y declara otro.
      </span>
    </p>

    <label class="field">
      <span class="label">Etiqueta</span>
      <input
        class="input"
        name="label"
        maxlength="64"
        required
        autocomplete="off"
        placeholder="Ej.: Enviar a revisión"
      />
      <span class="small hint">
        Es el texto del botón que verá quien mueva el registro.
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class="check">
      <input type="checkbox" name="requires_reason" />
      <span>Pide un motivo escrito</span>
    </label>
    <p class="small hint">
      Con esto marcado, el movimiento no se ejecuta sin una razón, y la razón
      queda en la bitácora.
    </p>

    <label class="field">
      <span class="label">Campos requeridos</span>
      <input
        class="input"
        name="requires_fields"
        autocomplete="off"
        placeholder="Ej.: target_date, next_step"
      />
      <span class="small hint">
        Nombres de campos del registro, separados por comas. El movimiento no se
        ofrece mientras alguno esté vacío en ese registro.
      </span>
    </label>

    <div class="pair">
      <GraphPicker
        facet="move-guard"
        label="Condición"
        placeholder="Sin condición"
        hint="Una comprobación registrada en el servidor, que puede rechazar el paso."
      />

      <label class="field">
        <span class="label">Orden</span>
        <input
          class="input"
          type="number"
          name="order"
          min="0"
          max="32767"
          autocomplete="off"
          inputmode="numeric"
        />
        <span class="small hint">
          Déjalo vacío para ponerlo al final de los que salen de ese estado.
        </span>
      </label>
    </div>

    <p class="small error" data-field="move-error" hidden></p>

    <p class="restore" data-field="move-restore" hidden>
      <button
        class="btn btn-secondary"
        type="button"
        data-action="restore-move"
      >
        <Icon name="refresh" size={16} />
        Restaurar el movimiento retirado
      </button>
    </p>

    <div class="dialog-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-action="close-dialog">
        Cancelar
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" data-action="submit-move">
        <Icon name="check" size={16} />
        <span data-field="move-submit">Declarar movimiento</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>

<style>
  .dialog {
    width: min(600px, calc(100vw - var(--space-6)));
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: var(--border-width) solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background-color: var(--carta);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lifted);
    color: var(--tinta);
  }

  .dialog::backdrop {
    background-color: var(--scrim);
  }

  .dialog form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .lead {
    color: var(--tinta-media);
  }

  .field[hidden],
  .error[hidden],
  .restore[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .pair[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .ends-value {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--tinta-suave);
  }

  .check {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    min-height: 32px;
    font-size: var(--text-small-size);
  }

  .check input {
    accent-color: var(--cobalto);
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    flex: none;
  }

  .hint {
    color: var(--tinta-media);
  }

  .error {
    color: var(--rojo-ink);
  }

  .dialog-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .pair {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
